  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obobe bwa Mwanyabaanto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanyabaanto bakagenderera komentekana ase ense, na abana abaiseke bakaiborwa agwo ase baare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamura ba Nyasae bakarora abaiseke ba Mwanyabaanto ng’a nigo baare nebieni ebiya, bakanyuoma ase ogwechorera abakungu korwa ase abaiseke baria koreng’ana buna baabagogetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene agateeba: “Omoika one tokonyara komenya ime ase Mwanyabaanto kare na kare, ekiagera ere nomobere ogokwa. Ase ayio emiaka yaye nigo erabe rigana erimo na emerongo ebere yoka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio, na kogenderera, amamonto namenyete ase ense, ekero abana abamura ba Nyasae baare konyuoma abaiseke ba Mwanyabaanto na koibora abana. Abwo nabwo baarenge amamonto yogokumia, are gotogigwa agwo kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akarora ng’a obobe bwa Mwanyabaanto bwabeire obonge ase ense, na kera okoroberia na okorengereria gwe chinkoro chiabo nokobe botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayi’Omonene akairianyeka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ekiagera atongete Mwanyabaanto ase ense, agaichana ase omoyo oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene agateeba: “Ninsirie Mwanyabaanto abwo natongete mbarusie ase ense, gose tari Mwanyabaanto boka, korende ne ching’iti, na ebitongwa bikwagura, ne chinyoni chia igoro. Neitirie ekiagera natongete abanto abwo na ching’iti echio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Nuhu akanyora ogwancherwa ase obosio bw’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nuhu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo noro omooroberio bw’ororeeria rwa Nuhu. Ere nigo areenge omonyaboronge na omoikeranu ase ekiaare kiaye; ere akaba ogotaara amo na Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nabwate abana abamura batato, nabwo Shemu, na Hamu, na Yafeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ense ekaba yasarekire ase obosio bwa Nyasae, egaichorwa nobotindi na okoregana kwegeitano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae akarora ng’a ense yatutukanire, ekiagera kera omonto obwatirie chinchera chi’obotutukanu ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nuhu okoagacha obwato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nyasae agateebia Nuhu: “Narorire ng’a ninsirie Mwanyabaanto, ekiagera baichoirie obotindi na oboregani ense, ase igo nimbasirie amo nense yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eroiserie obwato obonene bw’emete y’ebirobo; obonachane nechitoto ime ebinyomba, na oboome eramu ime na isiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwato obwo nigo oraboroisie iga: Obotambe bwaye nigo borabe obw’ebirengo bi’amaboko amagana atato, na obogare bwaye amaboko emerongo etano, na obotambe bwaye gochia igoro amaboko emerongo etato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inse y’ekerama otige ribaga ri’okorenta oborabu ase obwato obwo, orikore obotambe gochia igoro obw’ekerengo gi’okoboko okomo, obeke egesieri rikere ensemo. Onachane obwato obwo ase amarongo atato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki rora, nindete etoigo igoro y’ense, ninsirie Mwanyabaanto na binde bionsi bire moyo; kera egento kere moyo ase ense goika gekwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ninkore egeteebanio kiogotianania naye; aye nosoe ase obwato ime amo nabamura bao, na mokao, na baka bamura bao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na orente ching’iti ase obwato ime, na chinde chionsi chire moyo, korwa ase kera egesaku, ibere ibere, chinsacha ne chinkuungu, chibe moyo amo naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase kera egesaku gie chinyoni, ne ching’iti chionsi, na echikwagura igoro ase ense, ochirente ibere ibere amo naye, erinde chibe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oire endagera egochia koriegwa, oyegache erio eyio nebe endagera yaino na ey’echingi’ti ne chinyoni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuhu nabo akorete igo; agakora ayio onsi koreng’ana buna Nyasae amochigeete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
